   "format": "kv",
   "notes": "'key=value' per line, no spaces, no sections (port/src/aurora/settings_aurora.c at v0.5.1). Read once at start; the settings page rewrites the whole file. Ints are clamped to each key's range on read; unknown keys are kept (portSettingsExtraSet). Path is Aurora's user folder (SDL pref path, expected to be the app's internal files dir); not verified on a device. Memory cards live in the same folder. TTYD_SET_<key> environment variables override a key for one run."
  }
 },
